sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Browser (React)
    participant C as OrderController (web thread)
    participant X as Exchange
    participant W as SymbolWorker (worker-TCS)
    participant E as SymbolEngine
    participant M as MatchingStrategy
    participant B as EventBus
    participant BR as MarketDataBridge
    UI->>C: POST /api/orders {TCS, BUY, LIMIT, ₹4,090, 10}
    C->>X: submit(OrderRequest)
    X->>W: enqueue(command) — BlockingQueue.offer
    X-->>C: CompletableFuture (not done yet)
    Note over C: waits on the future (≤ 5 s)
    W->>E: command.execute(engine) — on the worker thread
    E->>E: gate + session: may this order trade now?
    E->>M: strategies.forType(LIMIT).match(order, book)
    M-->>E: MatchResult (trades, rested?)
    E->>B: OrderAccepted, TradeExecuted × n, BookChanged
    B->>BR: onEvent(...) — queue it (fast)
    W-->>C: future.complete(result)
    C-->>UI: 200 {order, trades, rested}
    Note over BR: every 100 ms
    BR-->>UI: STOMP /topic/book.TCS, /topic/trades.TCS
